<title>USA: Flagstar Q4 net oper loss narrows to $0.75.</title>
<headline>Flagstar Q4 net oper loss narrows to $0.75.</headline>
<dateline>SPARTANBURG, S.C. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.75     loss	 $0.67</p>
<p> Net loss		  28,196     loss	24,816</p>
<p> Revs		     661,469		  576,660</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  42,434		   42,434</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.35     loss	 $1.64</p>
<p> Net loss		  85,460     loss	55,199</p>
<p> Revs		   2,542,302		2,571,487</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  42,434		   42,431</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Flagstar Companies Inc.</p>
<p>Including dividends on preferred stock, Q4 1996 net operating loss was $31.7 million, or $0.75 per share, compared to $28.4 million, or $2.47 per share, for Q4 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
